  (text "GND: Feather JP1.13 is the only GND pin -> heat-shrunk splice to SW2 C, R2, C1, D2 K. SW1 OFF lug -> splice on the battery black lead (JST- = GND)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 216 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f3eaf7c5-a4f2-5219-8a14-c50593abc379"))
  (text "SW1: knob at the USB end = OFF: common (EN) connects to the OFF-end lug (GND) -> 3.3 V regulator off. Check which lug with a meter."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 222 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "cfbcbd7c-22d0-595b-ae28-49df77b86312"))
  (text "U1 JST+ and BAT are the same node on the Feather (VBAT); 3V3 (STEMMA QT) is switched by EN."
